WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.930
Look into a rock pool.

2
00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:04.950
Limpets cling to the
rock, among barnacles,

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.300
periwinkles, seaweeds and anemones.

4
00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:12.990
Now picture a rainforest: a completely
different set of living things,

5
00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:15.220
in a completely different place.

6
00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:18.340
Biologists call both of them ecosystems.

7
00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:22.090
The same word, for two places
that look nothing alike.

8
00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:25.610
So what do these two places
actually have in common?

9
00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:28.790
In this mission, you'll
build the levels of ecology,

10
00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:32.280
from one species to
every species in a place.

11
00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:35.910
Then you'll meet the factors that
decide where a species is found,

12
00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:37.950
and how many of it there are.

13
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.760
Your mission: find out what these
two very different ecosystems share.
